-- title:
--   Commute GHalf Sandwich Split Succ Iff
-- statement:
--   **The split-successor qSDD relation is equivalent to a move-chain base relation.**
--
--   Let `params` have a field model, let `psi_bi` be a quantum state on `ι x ι`, let `family` be an indexed polynomial family, let `r` be a natural number, and let `delta` be an error. Then the qSDD relation between the ordered and rotated head-tail families at length `r+1`, under the uniform distribution on `SliceQuestion(params) x PointTuple(params,r+1)`, is equivalent to the relation between the move source family and recursive target family at length `r`, under the uniform distribution on `MoveQ(params,r)`:
--
--   $$
--   \begin{aligned}
--   &\operatorname{SDDOpRel}\!\left(\psi_{bi},\operatorname{Unif}(\operatorname{SliceQuestion}(\mathrm{params})\times\operatorname{PointTuple}(\mathrm{params},r+1)),
--   \operatorname{headTailOrderedFamily}(\mathrm{params},\mathrm{family},r+1),
--   \operatorname{headTailRotatedFamily}(\mathrm{params},\mathrm{family},r+1),\delta\right)\\
--   &\quad\Longleftrightarrow\\
--   &\operatorname{SDDOpRel}\!\left(\psi_{bi},\operatorname{Unif}(\operatorname{MoveQ}(\mathrm{params},r)),
--   \operatorname{commuteGHalfSandwich\_moveSourceFamily}(\mathrm{params},\mathrm{family},r),
--   \operatorname{commuteGHalfSandwich\_recursiveTargetFamily}(\mathrm{params},\mathrm{family},r),\delta\right).
--   \end{aligned}
--   $$
--
--   The equivalence is the reindexing step that exposes the first tail coordinate and converts the length-`r+1` comparison into the base relation for the finite move chain.
--
--   Formalization credit: Sirui Lu, Ruixuan Deng, Yanqiao Zhu, and Zhengfeng Ji (arXiv:2609.19814). Mathematical source: Zhengfeng Ji, Anand Natarajan, Thomas Vidick, John Wright, and Henry Yuen (arXiv:2009.12982).
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The source declaration is `MIPStarRE.LDT.Pasting.commuteGHalfSandwich_split_succ_iff`; its Lean statement gives the exact quantifier order and all boundary hypotheses.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/LionSR/MIPStarRE/blob/f382c801026f53a9efc260fdee707cb35e0adb15/MIPStarRE/LDT/Pasting/ComparisonLemmas/CommuteGHalfSandwich/MoveChain/Base.lean#L102-L177

